- **Modalities:** Text, code in; text, code out
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** $0.75/$3.75 per 1M (Cyber via Fairwind) — note: Restricted Fairwind Program (no public pricing, no Zen Free ID)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary

